0T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4077320-1841579228663653","game_id":"steam-4077320","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog 2: It's in the cards","summary":"(Banner art: Twilight Knight by Vincent Graphic Art)Attention Cardaire players! I'm sorry to say there is going to be a re-pair for round 3. Please hold tight while we print out the new pairings.It's your humble Cardaire dev aeiou here! Today I wanted to talk about something fairly important to card games... Cards!What is it about these little paper rectangles that make them so addictive? I would argue that it starts with the game design behind them. Let's take a deep dive into some new features","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T20:17:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4077320-1833968530900888","game_id":"steam-4077320","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Making a Better Opponent","summary":"(Banner art: Harmonious Stag by Zalogon) Attention Cardaire players! Your round 3 pairings are now up! Oh also, it's aeiou here, your humble Cardaire dev. If there's one thing I enjoy as much as making card games, it's TALKING ABOUT making card games.So I wanted to take a second to check in and talk about everyone's favorite topic. The enemy duel AI. If there was one piece of feedback I heard loud and clear from the original Cardaire, it was about the opponents. Enemy AI was the biggest complain","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T15:48:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530900888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4077320-1832065502813036","game_id":"steam-4077320","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1.37","summary":"Enjoying throwing some cards? Pull something sick from the Lucky Draw machine? Gwen punch your face in and make you rethink your deck building choices? However things are going for you, I hope you're enjoying this little early preview of the full game. I have a small list of updates I wanted to push live while the demo is still up, and an even larger list of mostly QOL updates that have been added to my backlog from suggestions that I am going to look into before launch. Remember kids, devs who ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T18:04:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502813036","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4077320-1816849002017328","game_id":"steam-4077320","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Cardaire: Eternal Aces!","summary":"Attention Cardaire Duelists!aeiou here, your humble Cardaire creator. I've been bursting at the seams with excitement to announce my next project for a few months now. But it’s finally time for me to loosen those seams and announce…Cardaire: Eternal Aces !!!!I hope you enjoy the little trailer I've put togther, throw your local game dev a wishlist if ya can. Dev work on the next game has been buzzing along at a great pace, enough so that I felt it was time to get a Steam page up to show off prog","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-22T18:36:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002017328","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4077320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:30Z","status":"ok","all_sourc